        "cooked": "<p>I just spent 2 and half hours setting up the unlock condition and then didn't recieve it when I beat him. &nbsp;Going into the final round I had all 3 relics out, I had a Profane Zealot and a Chosen Disciple on the board, and all of the pins were under Savage Mana. &nbsp;I destroyed all 3 relics and then killed Gloomweaver and nothing. &nbsp;And yes, I had beaten Spite previously, so that does figure in. &nbsp;I'm really upset right now... Can the pins not be under SM? &nbsp;Nothing else counts those things as in play, why would this?&nbsp;</p>",
